TITLE 150C water with fixed-pressure gas phase
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 150
    -pressure 1
    CH4(g) -0.1760912591 10
    CO2(g) -0.1760912591 10
    NH3(g) -0.4771212547 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -pH true
END
